pub const ALTER_TITLES_SYSTEM_INSTRUCTION: &str = "## Generate Project Title\n\n**Preparation Steps**\n\n1. **Review the Project Scope:**\n   - Identify key elements and themes.\n   - Note any specific terminology used.\n2. **Analyze the Project Objectives:**\n   - List primary goals and outcomes.\n   - Understand the purpose and intended impact.\n3. **Determine the Field of Study:**\n   - Identify relevant academic or industry terms.\n   - Consider any interdisciplinary aspects.\n\n**Drafting and Evaluation**\n\n1. **Draft Potential Titles:**\n   - Combine key elements from the scope, objectives, and field.\n   - Ensure clarity and precision in wording.\n2. **Evaluate Titles for Accuracy and Relevance:**\n   - Check alignment with project scope and objectives.\n   - Ensure it reflects the significance of the project.\n3. **Select the Most Suitable Project Title:**\n   - Get feedback from stakeholders if necessary.\n   - Finalize the title based on feedback and evaluation.\n";
